ono dall'interno di un magazzino al centro del campo di battaglia di Shanghai. Il loro nemico è l'esercito giapponese, che li ha completamente circondati.","tagline":"Non si arresero mai. E la storia divenne leggenda."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Eight Hundred","overview":"In 1937, eight hundred Chinese soldiers fight under siege from a warehouse in the middle of the Shanghai battlefield, completely surrounded by the Japanese army.","tagline":"Based on the true story of one of the greatest battles of WWII."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"八佰","overview":"1937年，日本帝国主义发动全面侵华战争。淞沪会战末期，中日双方激战已持续近三个月，上海局势危急。国民革命军第88师第262旅第524团团副谢晋元奉命率部坚守苏州河畔的四行仓库，掩护主力部队撤退。由于苏州河对岸就是公共租界，租界内的中外人士也亲眼见证了这场惨烈的保卫战。为壮声势，守军对外号称“八百壮士”。在接下来的四天里，羊拐、端午、老铁、老算盘等人在生死考验中展现出各自不同的人性，也共同见证了一段悲壮的历史……","tagline":"舍身取义，儿所愿也。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fENYuJL71ghxKWJjlmTmubFf75.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x2WhpsSikzftIScNKkcSgwlGwHk.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":508935,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fENYuJL71ghxKWJjlmTmubFf75.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fENYuJL71ghxKWJjlmTmubFf75.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fENYuJL71ghxKWJjlmTmubFf75.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fENYuJL71ghxKWJjlmTmubFf75.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vMcwmwGXjBLIxs6Pv3cmAYPJMoT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vMcwmwGXjBLIxs6Pv3cmAYPJMoT.jpg","language":"it","width":1150,"height":1725},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d1ccCaxiNP3ZpWtjHsf8jcm1vYK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/